WEBVTT

00:00:03.209 --> 00:00:07.499
Multi-Tenancy, Tenants lists every tenant of the application.

00:00:07.499 --> 00:00:12.300
Each row shows the tenant's name, with badges for its state and, when

00:00:12.300 --> 00:00:16.397
they are set, its category, database provider, and recipe.

00:00:16.397 --> 00:00:20.109
The description and host name, if any, appear below.

00:00:20.568 --> 00:00:25.009
The search box finds tenants by name, host name, or URL prefix.

00:00:25.009 --> 00:00:29.386
The Category, State, and Sort menus narrow and order the list.

00:00:29.386 --> 00:00:33.698
Selecting a state badge shows only the tenants in that state.

00:00:34.199 --> 00:00:38.509
To act on several tenants at once, select their checkboxes.

00:00:38.509 --> 00:00:43.749
The Actions menu then offers Disable and Enable for the selected tenants.

